{"title":"Tina Mote | Mathematics Educator","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"Tina Mote | Mathematics Educator"},"containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n```{=html}\n<a class=\"skip-link\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a>\n  <header class=\"site-header\">\n    <a class=\"monogram\" href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Tina Mote\">TM<span aria-hidden=\"true\">.</span></a>\n    <nav aria-label=\"Main navigation\">\n      <a href=\"#research\">Research</a>\n      <a href=\"#experience\">Experience</a>\n      <a href=\"#education\">Education</a>\n      <a href=\"#contact\">Contact</a>\n    </nav>\n\n  </header>\n  <main id=\"main\">\n    <section class=\"intro\" aria-labelledby=\"name\">\n      <div class=\"intro-text\">\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Mathematics · Education · Leadership</p>\n        <h1 id=\"name\">Tina Mote</h1>\n        <p class=\"role\">Tenured Mathematics Faculty, Triton College</p>\n        <p class=\"bio\">I am a mathematics educator and doctoral student. My research focuses on trauma-informed pedagogy in mathematics teaching.</p>\n        <p class=\"bio\">My experience spans mathematics instruction, developmental education, curriculum design, and faculty development.</p>\n      </div>\n      <figure class=\"portrait-block\">\n        <div class=\"portrait\"><img src=\"assets/tina-profile.png\" alt=\"Tina Mote\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></div>\n      </figure>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"research section\" id=\"research\" aria-labelledby=\"research-title\">\n      <h2 id=\"research-title\">Math trauma affects a lot of students.</h2>\n      <div class=\"research-bottom\">\n        <p>My research brings together mathematics education and trauma-informed pedagogy within the field of higher education leadership.</p>\n        <div class=\"research-note\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Doctoral studies</span><p>Higher Education Leadership<br>Sam Houston State University</p></div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"experience\" aria-labelledby=\"experience-title\">\n      <h2 id=\"experience-title\">Teaching &amp; Leadership</h2>\n      <article class=\"entry\">\n        <p class=\"date\">August 2013 — Present</p>\n        <div><h3>Tenured Mathematics Faculty</h3><p class=\"institution\">Triton College <span>· River Grove, Illinois</span></p><p>I teach Calculus I, Calculus II, Calculus III, Differential Equations, and Linear Algebra.</p></div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"entry\">\n        <p class=\"date\">August 2009 — June 2013</p>\n        <div><h3>Developmental Education Coordinator<br>&amp; Mathematics Instructor</h3><p class=\"institution\">Lamar Institute of Technology <span>· Beaumont, Texas</span></p><p>Coordinated full-time and adjunct faculty in developmental English and mathematics, including training in department procedures and technology.</p></div>\n      </article>\n      <div class=\"expertise\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Areas of experience</p><p>Higher Education <span> / </span> Teaching <span> / </span> Curriculum Design &amp; Development <span> / </span> Staff Development</p></div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section reviews\" id=\"performance-review\" aria-labelledby=\"review-title\">\n      <h2 id=\"review-title\">Student Perspectives</h2>\n      <div class=\"rating-summary\"><p><strong>4.9 <span>/ 5</span></strong><span>Overall rating · 55 student ratings</span></p><p><strong>100%</strong><span>Would take again</span></p></div><p class=\"rating-date\">Rate My Professor · Checked September 12, 2026</p>\n      <div class=\"quote-grid\">\n         <figure><blockquote>“Professor Mote is a super caring person and makes math very easy to understand. She is helpful with any questions and wants you to succeed. I found her way of teaching extremely helpful especially because math can be hard to learn. If anyone isn't good at math or scared, definitely take Tina Mote as your professor...”</blockquote></figure>\n          <figure><blockquote>“I'm not someone who is good at math, and I've always had a fear of it. But professor Mote is an excellent professor for someone like me who is intimidated by it. The problems were broken down well, and explained simply. She truly cares, and wants you to succeed.”</blockquote></figure>\n          <figure><blockquote>“Professor Mote is an amazing teacher! She does a great job explaining and simplifying concepts so that you understand it. She genuinely cares about her students and is always there for you.”</blockquote></figure>\n          <figure><blockquote>“Tina was seriously the best professor I have ever had. She was always responding to questions and emails right when I sent them and helped sooo much.”</blockquote></figure>\n      </div>\n      <a class=\"text-link\" href=\"https://www.ratemyprofessors.com/professor/2229445#ratingsList\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Read more student reviews ↗</span></a>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"education\" aria-labelledby=\"education-title\">\n      <h2 id=\"education-title\">Education</h2>\n      <article class=\"entry\"><p class=\"date\">2025 — In progress</p><div><h3>Doctor of Education (Ed.D.), Higher Education Leadership</h3><p class=\"institution\">Sam Houston State University</p><p>Research focus: trauma-informed pedagogy in mathematics teaching.</p></div></article>\n      <article class=\"entry\"><p class=\"date\">2006 — 2009</p><div><h3>Master of Science, Mathematics</h3><p class=\"institution\">McNeese State University</p></div></article>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"contact section\" id=\"contact\" aria-labelledby=\"contact-title\">\n      <div><p class=\"eyebrow\">05 / Contact</p><h2 id=\"contact-title\">Let’s connect.</h2></div>\n      <a class=\"contact-button\" href=\"mailto:tinamote@triton.edu\">tinamote@triton.edu <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n  <footer><p>© 2026 Tina Mote</p><a href=\"#\">Back to top ↑</a></footer>\n```\n","srcMarkdownNoYam